
- Extract util, util-lookup
- "find -type f | wc " to get number of files fore each directory
- cp -r util/org DST/org; cp -r util-lookup/org DST/org
- "find -type f | wc" make sure number of files is the sum of original totals
- copyAddMeta util/META META; copyAddMeta util-lookup/META META
  look around to be sure
- mv META into DST
- jar -cf ../util-lookup-bundle-290.jar org META-INF/


